Package: omnios-desktop
Version: @OMNIOS_VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OmniNodeCo <https://github.com/OmniNodeCo/OmniOS>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: unattended-upgrades, apt-config-icons
Homepage: https://github.com/OmniNodeCo/OmniOS
Description: OmniOS desktop identity, branding and system integration
 OmniOS Desktop is a consumer KDE Plasma operating system based on Debian 13
 Stable. This package carries the parts of OmniOS that are not Debian packages:
 the operating-system identity, the logo and wallpaper, the Plasma defaults,
 the Security Center launcher, the antivirus and snapshot helpers, and the
 desktop-safe hardening defaults.
 .
 Shipping them as a package means an installed OmniOS system receives OmniOS
 changes through ordinary automatic updates, instead of only through a new ISO.
